# Debugger settings for every Crest app scheme.
#
# The core's .NET runtime pauses its threads for garbage collection with
# SIGUSR1 and handles the signal itself. The debugger passes it on without
# stopping; a stop there holds the whole app, and a debug server Xcode leaves
# behind keeps it held after Xcode detaches.
process handle SIGUSR1 --notify false --pass true --stop false
